  "description": "Aero or endurance? The Shave combines both. A road bike that breaks categories and pushes you to ride fast for longer. Ergonomic for your longest rides. Aerodynamic for more speed. Aesthetic, so that it feels even better. With a lightweight carbon frame, long-distance geometry and integrated power meter, it takes your ambitions to the next level. Highlights: • AergoConcept frame design – Ergo Fit & Aero Shape • Carbon cockpit – aerodynamic, ergonomic, fully integrated • Setback seat post – carbon comfort with extra flex • 36 mm tyre clearance – more room for wider tyres • Electronic shifting – fast, precise, intuitive • Integrated power meter – power measurement in real time The Shave Ultegra Di2 is equipped with the electronic Shimano Ultegra Di2 groupset with 2x12 gears and integrated 4iiii power meter. Newmen A.50 carbon aero wheels with 32 mm wide Conti Grand Prix tyres ensure power savings and increased damping. The Novus Boost Evo saddle from Selle Italia also strikes an ideal balance between performance and comfort. ¹ approx. 7.8 kg, may vary by up to +/- 5 % due to manufacturing tolerances, weight for supersonic grey frame, size M, without pedals. For individual height adjustments, 30 mm spacers are fitted under the cockpit as standard. The illustrations show the Shave without spacers with a shortened steerer tube.",
